    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d72">

                <pb facs="0069" n="57" sameAs="frus:frus1940v05/pg57"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.20 Defense/67<hi rendition="#superscript"
                        >19/24</hi>:Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-09-10T17:00:00-04:00">September 10, 1940—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>218, My telegram 211, September 6, 6 p.m. The President gives approval on all
                    political points submitted but asks clarification on some particulars. Am
                    reporting on conversation by pouch to Welles personally.<anchor n="78"
                        xml:id="d72-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
